     "title": "Borde derecho de un panel",
     "html": "<div id=\"resize-demo\" class=\"z-solid\" style=\"position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:240px;padding:var(--z-space-4);border-radius:var(--z-radius-md)\">\n  Drag the right edge, or focus it and use the arrow keys.\n  <div role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" aria-label=\"Resize panel\" aria-valuenow=\"240\" aria-valuemin=\"160\" aria-valuemax=\"320\" class=\"z-resize\" data-side=\"right\" data-default-size=\"240\"></div>\n</div>",
